</div><!--.flyout-->
</li>
<li class="no-link"><a href="#">Admissions &amp; Aid</a>
<div class="flyout">
<div class="row">
<div class="col four">
<h2>Admissions &amp; Aid</h2>
<div><p>A high quality, affordable college education should be within the reach of every student. Our goal is 100% student success, and that begins with offering the first two years of your undergraduate education at a reasonable cost that can be paid without going into debt. Richard Bland College, Virginia’s only public, residential two year college, is also one of the Commonwealth’s most affordable</p>
</div>
</div><!--.col.four-->
<div class="col eight">
<ul class="sub-menu">
<li id="menu-item-50298" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-50298"><a href="https://www.rbc.edu/why-rbc/admissions-one-stop/">Why Choose RBC</a></li>
<li id="menu-item-23988" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-23988"><a href="https://www.rbc.edu/admissions/administrative-offices/">Office of Admissions</a></li>
