<li id="menu-item-32912" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-32912"><a href="https://www.rbc.edu/academics/student-success/">Statesman Scholars Financial Assistance</a></li>
<li id="menu-item-42012" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-42012"><a href="https://www.rbc.edu/admissions/administrative-offices/office-of-student-accounts/tuition-housing-rates/">Tuition &#038; Housing Rates</a></li>
<li id="menu-item-69507" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-69507"><a href="https://www.rbc.edu/admissions/administrative-offices/records-registration-office/forms/">Records &#038; Registration Forms</a></li>
