<section id='main'><p>NOTE: POLICIES RELATING TO STUDENT ADMISSIONS, CURRICULUM CHANGES, GRADES, ACADEMIC STANDING, AND OTHER RELATED POLICIES ARE LOCATED IN THE RBC COLLEGE CATALOG. ALSO SEE THE RBC STUDENT HANDBOOK FOR ADDITIONAL STUDENT-RELATED POLICIES.</p>
